  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental Protection Agency, Office of Chemical Safety and Pollution Prevention (OCSPP), OECD Work on the Environmental Health and Safety Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this grant is to provide financial support to the Organisation for Economic Cooperation and Development&apos;s (OECD&apos;s) work on the Environmenal Health and Safety Programme. The effort will support work on test guidelines; the assessment of chemicals and nanomaterials; capacity building; biosafety; facilitation of risk reduction; chemical accidents and pollutant release and transfer registers.</narrative>
  </description>
